; S021 ORB -- Strategy Tester run on a REAL broker symbol with real ticks (stage 2).
; Example: ICMarketsSC-Demo USTEC, M1, model "every tick based on real ticks", deposit 10000 USD.
; Unlike the offline custom symbol, this run pays the real spread and commission, so the
; equity curve is expected to be worse than the S021_tester_offline baseline.
;
; Logging is OFF on purpose. The log folder is named S021-mt5-acct<login> with no tester marker
; (S021_ORB.mq5), and ACCOUNT_LOGIN inside the tester returns the login of the attached account,
; so a tester run would otherwise append synthetic rows to the live account's events/days files.
;
; Enum codes: ServerTzRule/DayResetRule 0=UTC 1=FIXED 2=EET_US_DST 3=EET_EU_DST 4=CET_EU_DST
InpRiskPct=1.0
InpDailyRiskCapPct=0.0
InpMaxRealRiskWarnPct=0.0
InpInitialBalance=0.0
InpDailyGuardPct=0.0
InpMaxGuardPct=0.0
InpDayResetRule=2
InpDayResetFixedHours=0
InpServerTzRule=2
InpServerFixedHours=0
InpVerifyServerOffset=false
InpExitBufferMin=0
InpForceExitUtc=
InpDoubleFillPolicy=0
InpMagic=21021
InpHistoryDays=45
InpLogToCommon=false
InpWriteDaysCsv=false
InpTimerSeconds=60
